=== DEFECT FOUND AND FIXED ===
Bare-string id collections were accepted and iterated character-wise.
`input_ids="abc"` was stored as three ids "a","b","c", so the recorded key and
the queried key disagreed and a genuine repeat read as new work -- defeating
AC1 outright. Same root cause in WorkItem.input_ids and
InvocationResult.produced_ids (T01.6.1). Fixed at all three sites via
_id_tuple(); lists are coerced to tuples, bare strings refused. Regression
tests in TestBareStringIsNotSplit; mutation M7 confirms the guard is bound.

Second, smaller: mixed timezone-aware/naive timestamps raised an uncaught
TypeError from the store (the V8 / E-V5 / X-V5 defect family). Now refused
explicitly by _require_coherent_timestamps(). Mutations M8, M9 confirm.
